    <bpmn:process id="W_W1758" name="W1758. Post-Opening Inventory Rebalancing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: End of opening week; actual sales data available
Frequency: Weekly for first month; then transitions to standard replenishment
Volume: Rebalancing across ~35,000 SKUs per new store
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Category Managers, VP Supply Chain, DC Operations
Source: workflow W1758 — Post-Opening Inventory Rebalancing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1758_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1758_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1758_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1758_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1758_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1758_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1758_Lane2" name="VP Supply Chain">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1758_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1758_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1758_Start4" name="End of opening week; actual sales data available">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1758_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1758_Task5" name="Merchandise Planner analyzes first-week sell-through data: (a) fast movers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner analyzes first-week sell-through data: (a) fast movers (selling faster than initial plan): need immediate replenishment to avoid stockouts, (b) slow movers (selling slower than plan): may have excess stock — reduce replenishment frequency, (c) dead stock (zero sales): assess if SKU is appropriate for this store&#x27;s trade area, (d) promotional items: calculate promotional lift and replenishment need for rest of promo period
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1758_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1758_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1758_Task6" name="Adjust replenishment parameters: (a) update ROP and safety stock for fast…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Adjust replenishment parameters: (a) update ROP and safety stock for fast movers (increase), (b) reduce replenishment for slow movers, (c) expedite replenishment orders from DC for critical stockouts, (d) adjust auto-replenishment rules in system based on actual demand pattern
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 1–2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1758_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1758_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1758_Task7" name="Inter-store transfers (if needed): (a) if new store has excess stock of items…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Inter-store transfers (if needed): (a) if new store has excess stock of items that nearby stores need, initiate transfer per W22 (Stock Transfers), (b) if new store needs items available at nearby store, pull from closest store for immediate relief
Responsible (R): VP Supply Chain
Accountable (A): DC Operations
Duration: As needed</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1758_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1758_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1758_Task8" name="After 4 weeks: Merchandise Planner formalizes new store demand profile; system…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: After 4 weeks: Merchandise Planner formalizes new store demand profile; system auto-replenishment takes over with store-specific parameters based on actual sales history
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1758_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1758_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1758_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1758_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1758_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-354 (ensure controlled execution — Grand Opening Execution &amp; Post-Opening Stabilization (PA-37.3).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Merchandise Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1758_Assoc11" sourceRef="W1758_Annotation10" targetRef="W1758_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
