    <bpmn:process id="W_W1762" name="W1762. Lessons Learned &amp; Store Opening Process Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: 3 months after store opening
Frequency: ~10–15 sessions/year
Volume: 1 lessons-learned session per new store
Owner: VP Store Operations
Participants: VP Store Operations, Store Opening Coordinator, functional leads, Store Manager
Source: workflow W1762 — Lessons Learned &amp; Store Opening Process Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1762_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1762_Lane1" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1762_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1762_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1762_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1762_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1762_Lane2" name="Store Opening Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1762_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1762_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1762_Start4" name="3 months after store opening">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1762_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1762_Task5" name="VP Store Operations convenes lessons-learned session (virtual or in-person, 2…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Store Operations convenes lessons-learned session (virtual or in-person, 2 hours): (a) what went well (best practices to standardize), (b) what didn&#x27;t go well (process failures, delays, budget overruns), (c) what surprised us (unexpected challenges), (d) what would we do differently next time
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1762_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1762_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1762_Task6" name="Store Opening Coordinator documents findings and recommendations: (a) timeline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store Opening Coordinator documents findings and recommendations: (a) timeline accuracy (actual vs. planned milestones), (b) budget accuracy (actual vs. planned costs), (c) quality of handoff from construction to operations, (d) system readiness and IT support effectiveness, (e) staffing and training effectiveness, (f) vendor and supplier readiness
Responsible (R): Store Opening Coordinator
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1762_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1762_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1762_Task7" name="Process improvements implemented: (a) update store opening playbook…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Process improvements implemented: (a) update store opening playbook (standardized procedures document), (b) update project charter template, (c) update critical path template, (d) revise vendor notification timeline if needed, (e) adjust training program based on staff readiness gaps observed
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1762_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1762_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1762_Task8" name="Annual review: VP Store Operations compiles lessons learned across all openings…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Annual review: VP Store Operations compiles lessons learned across all openings in the year; presents to COO for strategic improvements to store opening methodology
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 day/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1762_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1762_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1762_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1762_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1762_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-354 (ensure controlled execution — Grand Opening Execution &amp; Post-Opening Stabilization (PA-37.3).) | - operational: VP Store Operations review and approval gate
Owner: VP Store Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
